auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\n<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"426\">The <strong data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"75\">UFO High Bay Light</strong> collection is engineered to deliver powerful, uniform illumination for high-ceiling industrial and commercial environments. Designed with a compact circular \u201cUFO\u201d profile, this range combines high luminous efficacy with robust construction, making it ideal for warehouses, factories, workshops, logistics centers, gymnasiums, and large retail spaces.</p>\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"770\">Built with advanced LED technology, the collection ensures bright, flicker-free lighting while significantly reducing energy consumption and maintenance costs. The precision-designed optics provide wide beam distribution for maximum coverage, while the efficient heat-dissipation housing extends product lifespan even in demanding conditions.</p>\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"1040\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">With durable materials, stable performance, and easy installation, the UFO High Bay Light collection offers a reliable lighting solution for both new projects and energy-efficient retrofits\u2014delivering performance, efficiency, and long-term value in one compact design.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/des_icon_img.png\"></p>\n<h2>Applications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Office</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Malls</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Warehouse</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Commercial Area</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Shops</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Other General Use</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>", "published_at": "2026-01-27T16:56:50+05:00", "created_at": "2026-01-27T16:56:48+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-17T22:40:17+05:00", "vendor": "ORIENT Lighting", "product_type": "Street Light", "tags": ["3000K", "6500K", "DAY LIGHT", "ORIENT", "WARM LIGHT"], "variants": [{"id": 41503994183813, "title": "100 Watt / 6500k", "option1": "100 Watt", "option2": "6500k", "option3": null, "sku": "500000000444", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 34707921043589, "product_id": 7238401261701, "position": 1, "created_at": "2026-01-27T16:51:57+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-01-27T16:51:59+05:00", "alt": null, "width": 4096, "height": 4096, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/IMG_4663.jpg?v=1769514719", "variant_ids": [41503994183813, 41503994216581, 41503994249349, 41503994282117, 41503994314885, 41503994347653]}, "available": true, "price": "20140.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 7238401261701, "created_at": "2026-01-27T16:58:31+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-17T22:40:17+05:00"}, {"id": 41503994216581, "title": "100 Watt / 3000k", "option1": "100 Watt", "option2": "3000k", "option3": null, "sku": "500000000445", "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": {"id": 34707921043589, "product_id": 7238401261701, "position": 1, "created_at": "2026-01-27T16:51:57+05:00", "updated_at": "2026-01-27T16:51:59+05:00", "alt": null, "width": 4096, "height": 4096, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/IMG_4663.jpg?v=1769514719", "variant_ids": [41503994183813, 41503994216581, 41503994249349, 41503994282117, 41503994314885, 41503994347653]}, "available": true, "price": "20140.00", "grams": 0, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 2, "product_id": 7238401261701, "created_